OL,2,W+.!/*% *%*%/*%,.! /.!/*%,.!S,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 10 AUG
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1979FThe longest strike in UK TV
OL,7,Fhistory begins, blacking out ITV output
OL,8,F(with the exception of Channel TV, in
OL,9,Fthe Channel Islands).
OL,10,
OL,11,FThe strike ran for eleven weeks.
OL,12,FIndustrial action began the previous
OL,13,Fweek (mostly confined to Thames TV) but
OL,14,Fcame to a head at lunchtime when union
OL,15,Fmembers in some regions refused to
OL,16,Fscreen a network programme. They were
OL,17,Fsuspended.
OL,18,
OL,19,FThen, after an ultimatum from the
OL,20,Fcompanies, the biggest union involved -
OL,21,Fthe ACTT - called all its members out
OL,22,Fon indefinite strike.
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBOn This DayCClean FeedFNat TV
